## Purpose
Keep git hygiene and CI expectations clear at the boundaries where they matter.

## Applies When
- CI configs, build settings, or repo meta files are edited/opened.

## Git
- Feature branches: `feat/...`, fixes: `fix/...`, experiments: `exp/...`.
- Commit messages: concise subject + details; link issues.
- Use git-lfs for models/datasets.

## CI/CD
- Pipeline: ruff lint → ruff format check → pytest → build (optional).
- Block merges on failures; upload artifacts when size permits.
